## Files
- app/bhutan-tours/layout.tsx (modify)

## What to do
The /bhutan-tours route has metadata exported from both `layout.tsx` and `page.tsx`. The `page.tsx` version uses `buildSiteMetadata()` with canonical URL and is more complete. The `layout.tsx` version is a plain object with hardcoded title/description that duplicates and potentially conflicts.

Remove the `metadata` export from `layout.tsx`. The file should become a simple pass-through layout:

```tsx
export default function BhutanToursLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode
}) {
  return <>{children}</>
}
```

Remove the `import type { Metadata } from "next"` since it will no longer be used.

## Dont
- Do not modify page.tsx metadata
- Do not delete the layout.tsx file entirely (it may be needed for future nested routes)
- Do not add any new exports
